{
  "info": {
    "name": "Foresy API",
    "description": "Collection Postman pour tester l'API Foresy en production et développement.\n\n## Contrat d'erreur standardisé\n\nToutes les erreurs retournent : `{ \"code\": \"ERROR_CODE\", \"message\": \"...\", \"details\": {} }`\n\n## Variables\n\n- `base_url` : API en production (Render)\n- `base_url_local` : API en local\n- `jwt_token` / `refresh_token` : renseignés automatiquement par les scripts de test (signup/login/refresh)\n- `mission_id` / `cra_id` / `entry_id` : renseignés automatiquement après création",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "https://foresy-api.onrender.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "base_url_local",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "jwt_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "refresh_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "mission_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "cra_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "entry_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "client_company_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "description": "Endpoints de santé de l'API (publics).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Root - API Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": [""]
            },
            "description": "Racine de l'API. Retourne `{\"status\":\"API is live\"}`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Endpoint de health check pour Render."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "description": "Inscription, connexion, refresh, logout, révocation de tokens et OAuth.\n\n## Contrat d'erreur\n\nErreurs standardisées : `{ \"code\": \"ERROR_CODE\", \"message\": \"...\", \"details\": {} }`",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Signup",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Signup response is valid', function () {",
                  "    if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "        var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "        pm.test('Token present', function () { pm.expect(jsonData.token).to.not.be.empty; });",
                  "        if (jsonData.token) {",
                  "            pm.collectionVariables.set('jwt_token', jsonData.token);",
                  "        }",
                  "        if (jsonData.refresh_token) {",
                  "            pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', jsonData.refresh_token);",
                  "        }",
                  "    }",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"test@foresy.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/signup",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "signup"]
            },
            "description": "Créer un nouveau compte. Retourne `token` + `refresh_token` (HTTP 201)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login response is valid', function () {",
                  "    if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "        var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "        pm.test('Token present', function () { pm.expect(jsonData.token).to.not.be.empty; });",
                  "        if (jsonData.token) {",
                  "            pm.collectionVariables.set('jwt_token', jsonData.token);",
                  "        }",
                  "        if (jsonData.refresh_token) {",
                  "            pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', jsonData.refresh_token);",
                  "        }",
                  "    }",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"test@foresy.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Connexion (email + password). Retourne `token` + `refresh_token` (HTTP 200)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Refresh response is valid', function () {",
                  "    if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "        var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "        if (jsonData.token) {",
                  "            pm.collectionVariables.set('jwt_token', jsonData.token);",
                  "        }",
                  "        if (jsonData.refresh_token) {",
                  "            pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', jsonData.refresh_token);",
                  "        }",
                  "    }",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Rafraîchir le JWT à partir du `refresh_token`. Invalide l'ancien refresh_token (rotation)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Déconnexion — invalide la session courante (requiert Authorization)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Revoke Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/revoke",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "revoke"]
            },
            "description": "Révoque le token courant (requiert Authorization)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Revoke All Tokens",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/revoke_all",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "revoke_all"]
            },
            "description": "Révoque tous les tokens de l'utilisateur courant (requiert Authorization)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "OAuth Callback",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('OAuth callback response is valid', function () {",
                  "    if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "        var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "        if (jsonData.token) {",
                  "            pm.collectionVariables.set('jwt_token', jsonData.token);",
                  "        }",
                  "        if (jsonData.refresh_token) {",
                  "            pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', jsonData.refresh_token);",
                  "        }",
                  "    }",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"{{oauth_code}}\",\n  \"redirect_uri\": \"{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/{{provider}}/callback\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/{{provider}}/callback",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "{{provider}}", "callback"],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "provider",
                  "value": "google_oauth2",
                  "description": "Provider OAuth : `google_oauth2` ou `github`"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "OAuth callback — envoie le code d'autorisation reçu du provider.\n\nProviders supportés : `google_oauth2`, `github`.\n\n⚠️ Le code OAuth expire en ~30 secondes. Remplacez `{{oauth_code}}` par le code obtenu via l'URL d'autorisation du provider."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "OAuth Failure",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/failure",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "failure"]
            },
            "description": "Endpoint appelé en cas d'échec OAuth."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Missions",
      "description": "Gestion des missions professionnelles (requiert Authorization pour tous les endpoints).",
